      "descs": [
        {
          "lang": "da",
          "subject": "Undervandsarbejder",
          "details": "<p><strong>Indtil 1. juni 2025,</strong> udf&oslash;res undervandsarbejde i et omr&aring;de afgr&aelig;nset af en linje gennem position 1) -4).&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17,130'N - 009&deg; 53,407'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17,082'N - 009&deg; 53,366'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17,284'N - 009&deg; 52,451'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17,337'N - 009&deg; 52,479'E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Arbejdet udf&oslash;res af et fart&oslash;j som kan kontaktes p&aring; VHF kanal 16.</p>\n<p>Der anvendes dykkere.</p>\n<p>Skibsfarten aanmodes om at vise hensyn ved passage.</p>"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "subject": "Subsea works",
          "details": "<p><strong>Until 1 June 2025,</strong> subsea works will be carried out in an area bounded by a line through positions 1) - 4)</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17.130'N - 009&deg; 53.407'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17.082'N - 009&deg; 53.366'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17.284'N - 009&deg; 52.451'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 17.337'N - 009&deg; 52.479'E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The work will be carried out by a vessel which can be contacted on VHF channel 16.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Divers will be used.</p>\n<p>Mariners are requested to pass with caution.</p>"
        }
      ],
